{"text":"Dez etapas que o cliente acompanha sem te ligar. Veículo recebido. Em diagnóstico. Aguardando aprovação. Aprovado ou recusado. Aguardando peças. Em serviço. Em teste final. Pronto para retirada. Entregue. Mudou uma das dez etapas no BoxMonitor, o cliente recebe o aviso no celular. Você aperta um botão. Ele não precisa ligar, sabe? Manda pra oficina que o cliente não para de ligar.","voice":"YU8EsJtXFMyKMxYtheDk","settings":"{\"stability\":0.45,\"similarity_boost\":0.8,\"style\":0.3,\"use_speaker_boost\":true,\"speed\":1.05}","seconds":24.103,"charStarts":[0,0.104,0.267,0.325,0.395,0.43,0.546,0.662,0.731,0.801,0.836,0.894,0.917,0.94,0.964,0.998,1.033,1.068,1.126,1.184,1.207,1.242,1.289,1.324,1.358,1.382,1.428,1.474,1.521,1.579,1.637,1.683,1.741,1.776,1.8,1.869,1.904,1.997,2.02,2.067,2.09,2.125,2.171,2.206,2.264,2.334,2.415,2.508,2.589,2.705,2.775,2.891,2.926,2.984,3.03,3.053,3.088,3.123,3.158,3.204,3.251,3.344,3.413,3.506,3.576,3.692,3.727,3.82,3.889,3.959,4.017,4.04,4.075,4.145,4.226,4.307,4.423,4.47,4.493,4.54,4.609,4.725,4.772,4.888,5.004,5.074,5.12,5.166,5.224,5.294,5.352,5.399,5.445,5.48,5.503,5.538,5.596,5.631,5.7,5.735,5.828,5.944,6.037,6.177,6.223,6.304,6.42,6.49,6.536,6.606,6.676,6.792,6.861,6.885,6.92,6.943,6.966,7.012,7.047,7.105,7.163,7.233,7.314,7.454,7.523,7.639,7.686,7.755,7.872,7.941,7.988,8.034,8.069,8.127,8.173,8.208,8.255,8.29,8.359,8.406,8.522,8.603,8.719,8.8,8.835,8.905,9.021,9.091,9.16,9.207,9.3,9.381,9.462,9.578,9.659,9.776,9.822,9.892,10.008,10.066,10.136,10.205,10.321,10.344,10.379,10.426,10.484,10.53,10.612,10.67,10.786,10.902,10.96,11.099,11.169,11.238,11.285,11.32,11.378,11.401,11.459,11.494,11.552,11.587,11.61,11.656,11.68,11.738,11.807,11.889,11.947,12.063,12.132,12.249,12.272,12.295,12.411,12.492,12.585,12.666,12.759,12.817,12.864,12.957,12.98,13.096,13.177,13.293,13.375,13.491,13.526,13.56,13.595,13.653,13.7,13.746,13.793,13.874,13.909,13.978,14.002,14.118,14.153,14.211,14.246,14.339,14.478,14.548,14.617,14.64,14.687,14.722,14